  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut\n• the potato into fries. Place on a lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle over the Aussie spice blend, season with\n• salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between\n• two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-42c74f13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut the cauliflower into small florets. In a\n• medium bowl, combine the honey, mild chipotle\n• sauce, all-American spice blend, a pinch of\n• salt and some olive oil (1 tbs for 2 people / 2 tbs\n• for 4 people). On a plate, combine the panko\n• breadcrumbs and a good drizzle of olive oil. Toss\n• the cauliflower in the honey-chipotle mixture\n• until well coated. Press a handful of cauliflower\n• into the breadcrumbs, turning to coat. Repeat\n• with the remaining cauliflower.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-3b6dda32.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread the crumbed cauliflower over a second\n• lined oven tray. Bake the fries and cauliflower\n• until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Spacing out the cauliflower helps it\n• bake evenly!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-6e0e4bb1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the fries and cauliflower are baking, finely\n• chop the chives. In a small bowl, combine the light\n• sour cream and 1/2 the chives.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-d8e75d58.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice the cucumber. In a large bowl,\n• combine the cucumber, slaw mix, white wine\n• vinegar and 1/2 the sour cream mixture. Add a\n• pinch of salt and pepper, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-6d7e82b5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the honey-chipotle cauliflower, spiced fries\n• and sour cream and chive slaw between plates.\n• Sprinkle with the remaining chives. Serve with the\n• remaining sour cream and chive dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61371700dcf1e95cfd3b1832/step-8f4d8aa8.jpg"
    }
  ]
